{
  "name": "dsh-codex-efforting",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：把输入框的模型选择器换成卡片式推理等级滑块。强度只由档位在 reasoning.efforts 里的位置推出，适配器改名换序都不用改这里；动效随档位递增（静止 / 静色条 / 稀疏喷发 / 密集喷发），档位色还会画到输入框上（全覆盖柔光 + 外缘光环），输入框粒子、中心光晕、边缘辉光各有独立开关。无 Thinking Effort 的模型自动交回出厂选择器。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "model-selection",
    "reasoning-effort"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-model-selection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Mika-Maki/dsh-codex-efforting.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Mika-Maki/dsh-codex-efforting/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Mika-Maki/dsh-codex-efforting#readme",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
